deft html - commands (input -> output)
  to-docx  html -> docx  Convert the content to a Word document
  to-md    html -> md    Convert to Markdown; scripts and styles are dropped
  to-pdf   html -> pdf   Typeset as PDF, content not layout [beta]
  to-text  html -> txt   Extract the readable text
More: deft html <command> --help
